<section id="A14" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix N </span>SyntheticChat examples</h2>

<figure id="A14.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A14.T10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 10</span>: </span><span id="A14.T10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example single-turn synthetic chat messages.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A14.T10.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A14.T10.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A14.T10.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A14.T10.5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Message 1</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A14.T10.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A14.T10.5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Message 2</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A14.T10.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Anyone have any luck finding caches from Geocaching.com’s early days? I’m specifically interested in ones from before 2005, back when descriptions were more vague and poetic. Feels like digital archaeology to me!</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">I once stumbled upon a cache in an old tin lunchbox hidden under a park bench. It only had a couple of old coins and a soggy notebook with log entries from 2002!</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A14.T10.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Anyone ever try making ASMR videos with, like, a dot matrix printer? The sounds those things make are weirdly soothing.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Dude, you gotta get a floppy disk drive going! That clickety-clack is pure gold. Might even layer in some dial-up modem sounds for that full 90s immersion.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A14.T10.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">OMG you guys HAVE to see this mirror I found at an estate sale. Sterling silver with etched mermaids!! Pictures to come when I’m home.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">That sounds INCREDIBLE! What era do you think it’s from? Is there a maker’s mark? Can’t WAIT to see the pics!</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A14.T10.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I’m working on a story where magic comes from drawing symbols in the air. Any tips on how to keep the system consistent?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Maybe have limitations based on the complexity or size of the symbols! And the symbols themselves could correspond to natural elements or abstract concepts for a symbolic flair.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A14.T10.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">I’m convinced we could recreate a Roman Thermopolium experience using modern ingredients and techniques. Just imagine, street food like that!</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Have you seen the recent paper on the analysis of ancient Viking bog butter? Apparently, it’s still somewhat edible! That Paleo-Gastronomy documentary from a few years ago got me thinking - can we learn from these past culinary traditions?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A14.T10.5.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You know, I really think ’snollygoster’ should make a comeback. Perfectly describes so many politicians today!</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Yes! And what about ’fudgel’? Imagine how useful that would be for describing bureaucratic nonsense.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A14.T10.5.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A14.T10.5.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Remember the Dramatic Chipmunk? I think we need to stage its triumphant return.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A14.T10.5.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A14.T10.5.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">OMG yes! We could totally give it a Gen Z twist! Like, put him on TikTok reacting to spicy food trends. Operation Lazarus is a go!</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A15" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix O </span>4chan /pol/ examples</h2>

<section id="A15.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">O.1 </span>Detoxification examples</h3>

<figure id="A15.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A15.T11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>: </span><span id="A15.T11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Examples of /pol/ messages detoxified via GDR. Profanity has been replaced with asterisks. Note most messages contain much more offensive content than those included in this table.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A15.T11.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A15.T11.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A15.T11.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original message</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A15.T11.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Refined message</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A15.T11.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T11.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> the people wanted brexit you ***. Eat **** and puk 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T11.5.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> Yeah England has 49% leftists and no leftists voted for brexit. How about the non British right? The lolbertarians? Kys murican.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A15.T11.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> People voted for Brexit. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T11.5.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> 49% of voters in England identify as left-leaning, and none of them voted for Brexit. How about non-British right-leaning voters and libertarians?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T11.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T11.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A15.T11.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T11.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T11.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> It’s like you want to be swarmed by foreigners and our national identity to be destroyed. LDP voters are **** just like the greens. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T11.5.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> Oh yeah righto…..you know foreigners built this country right? ****, **** and other Europeans? Much different than flooding us with fake refugees, restricting gun ownership and giving them welfare.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A15.T11.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> It seems as though you are concerned about immigration and its potential impact on national identity. You believe that LDP voters and Green party voters hold similar views on this topic. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T11.5.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> I understand your concern. Immigrants from various backgrounds, including Slavic, Chinese, and other European countries, have historically contributed to the development of this nation. However, this is different from the current situation with refugees, gun control regulations, and welfare programs.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T11.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T11.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A15.T11.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T11.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T11.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> the most efficient electric motors do not hold a candle to diesel in terms of torque, maybe in another few years 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T11.5.6.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> Both of you are ****. Go study up on electric motor theory before spreading your **** on the bet.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A15.T11.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T11.5.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T11.5.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> Currently, electric motors don’t produce as much torque as diesel motors, but the technology is improving rapidly. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T11.5.6.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> I disagree with your assessment. I would suggest further research on electric motor theory.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A15.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">O.2 </span>Question-answer extraction examples</h3>

<figure id="A15.T12" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A15.T12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 12</span>: </span><span id="A15.T12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Examples question-answer pairs extracted from pol100k. Profanity has been replaced with asterisks.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A15.T12.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A15.T12.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A15.T12.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T12.5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original messages</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A15.T12.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T12.5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Extracted question-answer pairs</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A15.T12.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T12.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T12.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1</span>: California is already pretty different from the other states I’ve lived in. People love moving there because the weather is great even though it’s mind bogglingly expensive on average. They just put more restrictions on guns and legalized non medical weed so the things you stated pretty much came true this week. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T12.5.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2</span>: Nice! I look forward to Califexit. I really hope the rest of the US gets drained of libtards then.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A15.T12.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Q: Is recreational marijuana legal in California? 
<br class="ltx_break">A: Yes 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Q: Did California recently implement stricter gun control measures? 
<br class="ltx_break">A: Yes 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Q: Is the weather in California generally considered good? 
<br class="ltx_break">A: Yes</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T12.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T12.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A15.T12.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T12.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T12.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T12.5.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1</span>: I **** hope they bring back mining tax that **** not renewable once they dig it out and sell it its **** gone 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T12.5.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2</span>: Yeah but then we price ourselves out of the market. The multinational mining companies would just down tools and move operations to Africa while they wait for it to be repealed again.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A15.T12.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Q: Is mining a renewable resource extraction process? 
<br class="ltx_break">A: No 
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Q: Where do multinational mining companies operate? 
<br class="ltx_break">A: Africa</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T12.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T12.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td>
<td id="A15.T12.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A15.T12.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A15.T12.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A15.T12.5.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 1:</span> GRRM is a **** hack, and his books have as much **** insight as the grand slam menu at Denny’s. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A15.T12.5.6.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Message 2:</span> you mean one of the greatest cultural acheivements in the history of the world? wow.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A15.T12.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:221.9pt;">
<span id="A15.T12.5.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Q: What restaurant has the Grand Slam menu? 
<br class="ltx_break">A: Denny’s</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
